WEBVTT

00:15:58.025 --> 00:16:01.740
Nedavno je krajnja trasa Haj Lajna,

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:03.356
to je treća trasa Haj Lajna,

00:16:03.356 --> 00:16:04.926
krajnja trasa Haj Lajna,

00:16:04.926 --> 00:16:07.728
bila spašena od interesa investitora,

00:16:07.728 --> 00:16:10.028
gde je nekoliko
vodećih gradskih investitora

00:16:10.028 --> 00:16:12.710
gradilo više od 2 kvadratna kilometra

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:15.010
na Hadson Jardsu.

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:16.971
Došli su i predložili mi

00:16:16.971 --> 00:16:19.530
da "privremeno demontiraju"

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:22.260
tu treću, krajnju trasu.

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:24.723
Možda se Haj Lajn ne uklapa

00:16:24.723 --> 00:16:27.610
u sliku svetlucavih gradskih nebodera

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:29.073
na brdu.

00:16:29.073 --> 00:16:31.797
Možda im je samo smetao.